{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization, cache keys, and tests, then fix the isolation issues and run the test suite.\n\nProject detail reads lack a membership check, list keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll check the project’s actual owner and use an encoded organization prefix to invalidate only that organization’s list variants.\n\nFixed owner-membership checks for project reads and updates. List cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting. Updates invalidate every list variant for only the owning organization. Cached lists still require membership.\n\nAdded regression coverage. Ran npm test and git diff --check: all 11 tests passed, exit code 0. No dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed owner-membership checks for project reads and updates. List cache keys now isolate organizations while preserving pagination and sorting. Updates invalidate every list variant for only the owning organization. Cached lists still require membership.\n\nAdded regression coverage. Ran npm test and git diff --check: all 11 tests passed, exit code 0. No dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":10,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-apul1kbx/tenant-cache-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":198,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-a88a995f66fa29702cf882a049891e28.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"write_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"error","action":"run","error":{"category":"command_failed","code"